# Oracle: VD dev-builtin (seven builtin devices, each made available by a `model` line with no
# `load`); DIALECT-VACASK run n2 ("Master 'vsource' not found." without one); run bp (a
# builtin's model line takes no parameter: "Parameter 'dc' not found.") → InvalidInSource P2103.
# codes: P2103 S0004
file "builtin_models.sim" deck
  title "builtin models"
  model vs source_v
  model is source_i
  model e vcvs
  model g vccs
  model h ccvs
  model f cccs
  model k mutual
  opaque vacask invalid "model vs2 vsource dc=1"
